      "id": "6b70e67e-5232-43c1-bf8c-73e9a71e543d",
      "name": "EventExposure",
      "description": {
        "content": "With an EventExposure you declare that your application publishes events\nof a specific type. This makes the events available for subscription by\nother applications. Each exposure is scoped to a zone and can define\nvisibility, approval strategy, and publisher-side scopes with filtering.\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
